# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist-ssr
*.local

# dist/ is deliberately NOT ignored. It is embedded into the Go binary with
# go:embed, so committing it keeps `go build .` working for anyone who does not
# have Node installed — which is most people building the agent. Rebuild it with
# `make webui` (or `npm run build` here) whenever the console changes.

